        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596999034018-abea57f9f54b?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NDM2NjU0MzF8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3" alt="Featured image of post dub" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;dubincdub&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dubinc/dub&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;dubinc/dub&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://dub.co&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&#34;Dub.co is the open-source link management infrastructure for modern marketing teams.&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/dubinc/dub/assets/28986134/3815d859-afaa-48f9-a9b3-c09964e4d404&#34;&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h3 align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;Dub.co&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
    The open-source link attribution platform.
    &lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;https://dub.co&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn more »&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#introduction&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ·
    &lt;a href=&#34;#features&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ·
    &lt;a href=&#34;#tech-stack&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ·
    &lt;a href=&#34;#self-hosting&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-hosting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ·
    &lt;a href=&#34;#contributing&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com/dubdotco&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/dubdotco?style=flat&amp;label=%40dubdotco&amp;logo=twitter&amp;color=0bf&amp;logoColor=fff&#34; alt=&#34;Twitter&#34; /&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32939407&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Hacker%20News-255-%23FF6600&#34; alt=&#34;Hacker News&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/dubinc/dub/blob/main/LICENSE.md&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/github/license/dubinc/dub?label=license&amp;logo=github&amp;color=f80&amp;logoColor=fff&#34; alt=&#34;License&#34; /&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;introduction&#34;&gt;Introduction
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dub.co is the open-source link attribution platform for modern marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free custom domains&lt;/strong&gt;: Create branded short links &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/how-to-add-custom-domain&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;with your own domain&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/blog/custom-domains&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;improve click-through rates by 30%&lt;/a&gt;. Paid plans also include a &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/free-dot-link-domain&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;complimentary custom domain&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced link features&lt;/strong&gt;: Supercharge your links with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/custom-link-previews&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;custom link previews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/device-targeting&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;device targeting&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/geo-targeting&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;geo targeting&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/link-cloaking&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;link cloaking&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/password-protected-links&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;password protection&lt;/a&gt;, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;: Dub provides &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/analytics&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;powerful analytics&lt;/a&gt; for your links, including geolocation, device, browser, and referrer information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QR Codes&lt;/strong&gt;: QR codes and short links are like peas in a pod. Dub offers &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/tools/qr-code&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;free QR codes&lt;/a&gt; for every short link you create. Feeling artsy? &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/custom-qr-codes&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Customize them with your own logo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/article/how-to-invite-teammates&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Invite your teammates&lt;/a&gt; to collaborate on your links. For &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/enterprise&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;enterprises&lt;/a&gt;, Dub offers &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/help/category/saml-sso&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;SAML SSO&lt;/a&gt; with Okta, Google, and Azure AD for higher security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tech-stack&#34;&gt;Tech Stack
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://nextjs.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Next.js&lt;/a&gt; – framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.typescriptlang.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;TypeScript&lt;/a&gt; – language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://tailwindcss.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Tailwind&lt;/a&gt; – CSS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://upstash.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Upstash&lt;/a&gt; – redis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://tinybird.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Tinybird&lt;/a&gt; – analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://planetscale.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PlanetScale&lt;/a&gt; – database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://next-auth.js.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;NextAuth.js&lt;/a&gt; – auth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://boxyhq.com/enterprise-sso&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;BoxyHQ&lt;/a&gt; – SSO/SAML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://turbo.build/repo&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Turborepo&lt;/a&gt; – monorepo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://stripe.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Stripe&lt;/a&gt; – payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://resend.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Resend&lt;/a&gt; – emails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://vercel.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Vercel&lt;/a&gt; – deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://pangea.cloud/services/domain-intel/reputation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Pangea&lt;/a&gt; - link scanning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;self-hosting&#34;&gt;Self-Hosting
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can self-host Dub.co for greater control over your data and design. &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/docs/self-hosting/guide&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Read this guide&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We love our contributors! Here&amp;rsquo;s how you can contribute:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dubinc/dub/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Open an issue&lt;/a&gt; if you believe you&amp;rsquo;ve encountered a bug.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dub.co/docs/local-development&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;local development guide&lt;/a&gt; to get your local dev environment set up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make a &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dubinc/dub/pull&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;pull request&lt;/a&gt; to add new features/make quality-of-life improvements/fix bugs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/dubinc/dub/graphs/contributors&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=dubinc/dub&#34; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;repo-activity&#34;&gt;Repo Activity
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://repobeats.axiom.co/api/embed/6ac4c94a89ea20e2e10032b932a128b6d8442e66.svg&#34;
	
	
	
